hide empty members
title Builder — InvoiceDraft hợp lệ
class InvoiceService <<client>>
class InvoiceBuilder {
 -cashierId?: string
-items: InvoiceLine[]
+setCashier(id): this
+setItems(items): this
+build(): InvoiceDraft
}
class InvoiceDraft <<type>> {
 id
code
cashierId
items
totalAmount
}
class InvoiceLine <<type>> {
 productId
productCode
productName
unit
quantity
unitPrice
subtotal
}
InvoiceService ..> InvoiceBuilder : fluent construction
InvoiceBuilder ..> InvoiceDraft : build()
InvoiceDraft *-- "1..100" InvoiceLine
note bottom of InvoiceBuilder
Không Director / ConcreteBuilder giả.
Kiểm tra snapshot không rỗng; quantity Int32 dương;
ID dòng không trùng; subtotal và tổng safe integer.
Sao chép items khi nhận và khi build.
Draft chưa có status; repository persist default PENDING.
Không có domain entity transition methods trong V1.
end note
@enduml
